{{!-- Doctor Welcome — bilingual founder-signed onboarding email (v5).
      Same body shipped in en/ AND ar/ paths (option (a)) so the
      template is language-agnostic at send time; user.lang only
      picks which file the loader reads first.

      This is a BODY PARTIAL — renderEmail() wraps it in
      _layout-doctor-welcome.hbs (registered in TEMPLATE_LAYOUTS,
      services/emailService.js), which supplies the document shell,
      masthead and footer. Do NOT reintroduce those tags here.

      Variables: nameAr, firstName, specialtyAr, specialtyEn,
                 password_setup_link, expiryDays.
      Both CTAs deliberately share ONE password_setup_link —
      per-language activation URLs are a separate task.

      This is a Handlebars comment, not an HTML one, so it is stripped at
      compile time and never reaches the recipient. Never write comment
      delimiters or mustache braces in this block: a nested closing
      delimiter ends the comment early and dumps the rest of this text
      into the sent email. --}}

